/**
 * Customer-facing "ticket reply" email send governance — coalescing +
 * circuit breaker.
 *
 * WHY THIS EXISTS (2026-08-31 incident). Two customers each received a burst
 * of 12-20 separate "New reply" emails inside a few hours. Root-caused
 * against EmailLog + TicketMessage: every single one was a genuinely
